{"product_id":"gid://shopify/Product/7317560819870","title":"KAIYODO Amazing Yamaguchi No.023 Iron Spider Figure Spider Man (Reissue)","old_description":"\u003ch3\u003eDetails:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe high-tech Spider-Man comes with a mechanical arm that moves freely. This arm can change shape for different action poses. It's designed based on the Iron Spider suit from Tony Stark, featuring a large mechanical arm that's about 8.7 inches long. Each arm has 4 joints for movement. The spider symbol on the chest is 3D with detailed edges, and the figure has a comic book-style look. The hands have different models for various poses, like web-shooting, and can attach to walls with a magnet, just like the previous Spider-Man toy. This figure is painted in the same red and gold as Iron Man and has a shiny finish. It also allows for many acrobatic poses with its jumping arm feature.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Information: \u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Dimensions ‏:\u003c/strong\u003e ‎ 6 x 12 x 16 cm; 360 g\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRelease date ‏:\u003c/strong\u003e ‎ July 31, 2021\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDate First Available ‏:\u003c/strong\u003e ‎ March 9, 2021\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eManufacturer‏ : ‎\u003c/strong\u003e 海洋堂\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eManufacturer reference ‏:\u003c/strong\u003e ‎ KYD01329\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e","new_description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eDescription\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe KAIYODO Amazing Yamaguchi No.023 Iron Spider Figure Spider Man Reissue brings the iconic Iron Spider suit to life with outstanding detail and articulation. This figure showcases the high-tech design inspired by Tony Stark's suit, featuring a large mechanical arm that moves freely and can be posed dynamically. The figure's comic book-style aesthetics combined with a shiny red and gold finish make it a standout collectible for fans and collectors alike.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eManufactured by Kaiyodo, this Spider Man figure includes a mechanical arm approximately 8.7 inches long with four joints for versatile movement. The 3D spider symbol on the chest is intricately detailed, and multiple hand models allow for various action poses including web shooting. Additionally, the figure's magnetic hands enable it to attach to walls, enhancing display options and playability.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eDetails\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Specifications:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e \u003cul style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"\u003e \u003cli\u003eAction Figure\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eArticulated\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003ePre-painted\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Item dimensions:\u003c/strong\u003e 6 x 12 x 16 cm\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Condition:\u003c/strong\u003e Brand New\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Manufacturer:\u003c/strong\u003e Kaiyodo\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Release Date:\u003c/strong\u003e July 31, 2021\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Recommended Age:\u003c/strong\u003e 15+\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003eMechanical arm approximately 8.7 inches long with four joints for flexible movement\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eMultiple interchangeable hands for different poses including web shooting\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eMagnetic hands allow figure to attach to walls for dynamic displays\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eDetailed 3D spider symbol on the chest with comic book-style design\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eShiny red and gold paint finish mimicking the Iron Man suit\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eCare instructions\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003eTo maintain the figure's appearance, clean gently with a soft, dry cloth to remove dust. Avoid using water or harsh chemicals that could damage the paint finish. Store the figure away from direct sunlight and extreme temperatures to prevent fading or warping. Handle with care to avoid damaging the mechanical arms and delicate parts during posing or display.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e","category":"figures","has_sufficient_data":true,"status":"success","error_message":null,"processed_at":"2026-03-08T16:08:56+09:00","processing_duration_ms":6858.426025}
